Adapt S9 Ultra early-claim fix to the existing Fedora X710 patch composition.

Fedora already starts a claimed device once after open; preserve that block
and add the delayed availability event instead of duplicating polling starts.
Also guard pre-open release/client disappearance against a NULL device.
Hardware discovery and measurement policy are unchanged.

